Smart Health Symptom Checker

This is a simple web application that helps users check their health based on the symptoms they provide. When a user enters their symptoms, the system predicts possible diseases using machine learning and gives helpful suggestions and precautions. It can also provide a basic health report.Why I Built This Project

Many people struggle to understand early health symptoms and delay medical help. This system gives a quick idea about possible health issues, so users can take better decisions in time.
What This System Can Do

Users can create an account and log in

Enter symptoms (like fever, headache, cough, etc.)

Predicts possible disease using AI/ML

